  "bodyHash": "923755ef6d125749",
  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>Particle Rain</strong> 使用更美观的粒子效果替换了默认天气，并增加了额外的雾、风&nbsp;和沙尘暴等天气效果。你甚至可以通过游戏内配置菜单添加或自定义天气效果。</p>\n<p>Fabric 版本需要&nbsp;<strong>Fabric API。</strong></p>\n<p>进行<strong>配置</strong>时，请使用命令 <code>/particlerain</code>&nbsp; 或加载器的模组列表菜单。</p>\n<p>有关常见的<strong>兼容性</strong>问题，请查看<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain%252f%2523teleports\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0\" width=\"775\" height=\"450\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>如果嵌入视频无法播放，请访问直接链接：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%252fembed%252foan4xH5RvH0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oan4xH5RvH0</a></span></p>\n<h3>雨粒子</h3>\n<p>呈倾斜下落，仿佛被风吹拂。暴风雨天气时风力更强。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/e0224f09c643c6f23a2d918b13ce51f3f7b77056.gif\"></p>\n<h3>雪粒子</h3>\n<p>下落时会缓慢旋转。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/d8ffb64861e7405ad69b1161dfc1839447c8ba9f.gif\"></p>\n<h3>沙尘暴</h3>\n<p>尘土与灌木丛在沙漠及其他干燥生物群系中飞扬。支持模组添加的生物群系。颜色将与下方的方块匹配。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/c48b84e2365bcae6c11de1e0c59ef3afcabc7b25.gif\"></p>\n<h3>生物群系色调</h3>\n<p>雨水粒子会匹配该生物群系的水体色调。原版生物群系的色调不会这么强。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/7022231f3fe77219004b9f4c5048eebf91965afb.png\"></p>\n<h3>水面涟漪</h3>\n<p>雨水落到水面时会出现。分辨率将匹配你的资源包。（可配置）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/8984bc251f2eeae49f12adb7bdd96c9b7599276f.gif\"></p>\n<h3>水流痕迹</h3>\n<p>雨水击中由硬质材料构成的墙壁时会出现。（可配置为在任何方块上显示）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/f2c6adb15f6e20529a018cec992de390d5c0c15c.gif\"></p>\n<h3>薄雾</h3>\n<p>降雨后，渗入地下的水分会蒸发回空气中，在地面上方形成薄雾云。这些薄雾也会自然出现在标记为 `#c:is_spooky` 和 `#c:is_wet/` 的生物群系中（此项同样可配置）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/1908ca46743f6e4c82b04eb93c991dfca734a43e.png\"></p>\n<h3>配置与自定义效果</h3>\n<p>你可以使用内置的配置菜单，为特定方块和生物群系创建各种氛围粒子效果，或编辑现有效果。</p>\n<p>通过命令 `/particlerain` 或模组菜单访问此界面。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\" alt=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/nrikgvxm/images/791d2bd8057572a0745517f5adbedb957cd96aab.png\"></p>\n<h3><del>水坑</del></h3>\n<p><em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puddles-floods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">水坑功能已重构，并作为独立模组发布。</span></a></em></p>\n<h2>其他链接</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain/issues?q=is:issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">问题追踪器</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpigc.art%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Discord</span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/particle-rain/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新日志 / 更新说明</a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fparticle-rain%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">备用镜像下载</span></a></li>\n</ul>",
